22 0 obj
<< /A 444 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating participant selection for a pregnancy failure clinic study from January 2019 to December 2023. Out of two thousand five hundred eighty-seven patients, eight hundred fifty-three were excluded geographically or clinically. Of the remaining one thousand seven hundred thirty-four participants, three hundred forty-six lacked thyroid function data and thirty-one were excluded for out-of-range TSH, resulting in one thousand three hundred fifty-seven for analysis.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 15 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
23 0 obj
<< /A 445 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows a scatter plot with regression lines comparing TSH levels to half-year average PM2.5 exposure, stratified by TPO antibody status \(negative in blue, positive in red\). Panel B is a forest plot showing beta coefficients and confidence intervals for different exposure time windows by TPO antibody status, highlighting significant interaction at three and six months.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 18 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
24 0 obj
<< /A 446 0 R /Alt (Heatmap displaying beta coefficients for thyroid function tests across twelve months before diagnosis, with red indicating positive and blue negative associations. Columns represent FT4, T3, TSH, and TPOAb status. Statistically significant values are marked with asterisks.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 19 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
